  "html": "<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:252px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Mutant_hulk.jpg\" title=\"Fire Mutant Hulk\"><img alt=\"Fire Mutant Hulk\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"183\" src=\"/images/Mutant_hulk.jpg\" width=\"250\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/Mutant_hulk.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>Fire Mutant Hulk</div></div></div>\n<p>Mutant Hulks are huge, slow monsters that appears in many dungeons. They have a stunning knock-back attack which they almost always uses for their first strike. <a href=\"/wiki/Mutant_Puker\" title=\"Mutant Puker\">Mutant Pukers</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Mutant_Pincers\" title=\"Mutant Pincers\">Mutant Pincers</a> are usually hanging out with Mutant Hulks as well.\n</p><p><b>Race:</b> Mutant\n</p><p><b>Class:</b> Fighter\n</p><p><b>Tip:</b> <i> Big and ugly, but vulnerable to <a href=\"/wiki/AoE\" title=\"AoE\">AoE</a> spells or a concerted attack.  Take them out first and then concerntrate on the fodder.</i>\n</p>\n<a name=\"Basic_Types\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Basic Types</span></h2>\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n<tr>\n<th>Name\n</th><th>Element\n</th><th>Habitat\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mutant Hulk\n</td><td>Poison\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Algernon\" title=\"Algernon\">Algernon</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mutant Fizzmaster Mixer\n</td><td>Fire\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Algernon\" title=\"Algernon\">Algernon</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Hell Hulk\n</td><td>Fire\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Tainted_Grove\" title=\"Tainted Grove\">Tainted Grove</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Overlord's_Sepulcher\" title=\"Overlord's Sepulcher\">Overlord's Sepulcher</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Dark_Forest\" title=\"Dark Forest\">Dark Forest</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Shadow Mutant Hulk\n</td><td>Shadow\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Vergrim's_Vexation\" title=\"Vergrim's Vexation\">Vergrim's Vexation</a>,<a href=\"/wiki/The_Mutanous_Malaise\" title=\"The Mutanous Malaise\">The Mutanous Malaise</a>, level 5 - 7, <a href=\"/wiki/Dingbat_Duhrill's_Pad\" title=\"Dingbat Duhrill's Pad\">Dingbat Duhrill's Pad</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Fire Mutant Hulk\n</td><td>Fire\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Algor's_Terror_Dome\" title=\"Algor's Terror Dome\">Algor's Terror Dome</a>, level 1 - 4\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Frostbitten Hulk\n</td><td>Ice\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Vergrim's_Vexation\" title=\"Vergrim's Vexation\">Vergrim's Supply Depot</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Ice Mutant Hulk\n</td><td>Ice\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Frump's_Misfortune\" title=\"Frump's Misfortune\">Frump's Misfortune</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>G'Rulkster\n</td><td>Ice\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Deathtroit\" title=\"Deathtroit\">Deathtroit</a> (off Frump's Level 1)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Poison Mutant Hulk\n</td><td>Poison\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Orok_Outpost\" title=\"Orok Outpost\">Orok Outpost </a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Toxic Mutant Hulk\n</td><td>Poison\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Widower's_Nest\" title=\"Widower's Nest\">Xhelduh's Hideout</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Frosty Hulk\n</td><td>Ice\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Ratsputin's_Gulag\" title=\"Ratsputin's Gulag\">Ratsputin's Gulag</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cinder Hulk\n</td><td>Fire\n</td><td>Lower <a href=\"/wiki/Ratsputin's_Gulag\" title=\"Ratsputin's Gulag\">Ratsputin's Gulag</a> offs, <a href=\"/wiki/Mutant_Mania\" title=\"Mutant Mania\">Mutant Mania</a>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n<a name=\"Uniques\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Uniques</span></h2>\n<a name=\"Specials\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Specials</span></h2>\n<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:182px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Fiery_Pygmy.jpg\" title=\"Cute L'il Fiery Pygmies\"><img alt=\"Cute L'il Fiery Pygmies\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"172\" src=\"/images/Fiery_Pygmy.jpg\" width=\"180\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/Fiery_Pygmy.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>Cute L'il Fiery Pygmies</div></div></div>\n<ul><li><b>Fiery Pygmy</b>- Look like miniature Fire Mutant Hulks. Follow <a href=\"/wiki/Fiery_Pygmy_Tracks\" title=\"Fiery Pygmy Tracks\">Fiery Pygmy Tracks</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Ruins_of_Castle_Caninenstein\" title=\"Ruins of Castle Caninenstein\">Ruins of Castle Caninenstein</a> to reach their lair.\n</li></ul>\n<p><br/><br/>\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Roh-Zee's_Assistant\" title=\"Roh-Zee's Assistant\">Roh-Zee's Assistant</a> - 2 of these Mutant Hulks guard Roh-Zee's Wardrobe in <a href=\"/wiki/Frump's_Misfortune\" title=\"Frump's Misfortune\">Frump's Misfortune</a>-Level 1\n</li></ul>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
}
